  "_decided": "8 Nov 2026, by the owner: atmospheric is a 16th mood; bittersweet counts as melancholic, philosophical as existential, depressing as bleak. The other flagged words stay out. Also 8 Nov: five lighter moods added (funny, whimsical, romantic, warm, tense), with feel words only; genre and topic words flagged. Romantic also counts romance, longing and passionate (the owner found In the Mood for Love and Portrait of a Lady on Fire missing). Also: compound tags that contain a mood's own word count (gay romance, romantic comedy, feel good movie, existential crisis…), except those that mean something else (not funny, slow motion, group psychology).",
